        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="Hn 11.10" corresp="#wit-lat"><pb n="557" ed="#liebermann"/>Si liber festis diebus operetur, emendet suum helfang<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="22" target="#Hn_11-10.lnote.oe.22"/> et saltem erga Deum<ptr type="liebermannNote" n="25" target="#Hn_11-10.lnote.oe.25"/> sedulo componat.</ab>
        <note type="editorial">New row (October 2026): Liebermann’s text transcribed from Gesetze I p. 557 (two independent readings of the page images, differences settled against the page); Liebermann’s print gives ‘Deum’ note number 25 (note 23 ‘Dominum Edd.’ belongs here); transcribed as printed</note>
